      "id": "claim_a47a013971054da48f2a383ac6199146",
      "statement": "Importing `deepagents_code` installs an always-on in-memory logging handler before debug-file configuration; it retains structured records in bounded per-level queues, preserves chronological snapshots with monotonic emission indices, and keeps one shared bounded bucket for custom levels.",
