      "id": "claim_31a04923c26d44f58caf2348ef5a9238",
      "statement": "The Textual Debug Console incrementally polls the in-memory log buffer, applies its severity filter and matching per-level display retention, and clearing its view advances the render position without deleting buffered logs; polling failures are contained so diagnostics cannot crash the app.",
